2329	uccT-NTYVMc	Rise of Kubernetes and the Cloud Native Computing Foundation - Chris Aniszczyk- FOSSASIA 2018	2018-03-23 05:43:13	Speaker: Chris Aniszczyk, CTO Cloud Native Computing Foundation\nInfo: https://2018.fossasia.org/event/speakers.html#chris-aniszczyk3223\n\nWe will discuss the lessons we have learned with containers so far including how Google (and other internet scale companies) have been developing and using containers to manage applications for over decade. His session will address the old world of node first development vs. the new world of cloud native computing along with discussing properties of a cloud native computing architecture – container packaged dynamically managed and micro-services oriented – and the benefits it can provide developers and end users.\n\nFurthermore we will cover the formation of the Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF) along with the contribution of its first hosted project: Kubernetes.\n\nRoom: Lecture Theatre\nTrack: Cloud, Container, DevOps\nDate: Friday, 23rd March, 10:30 - 10:55\n\nEvent Page: http://2018.fossasia.org\nFollow FOSSASIA on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fossasia/\nLike FOSSASIA on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fossasia/\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uccT-NTYVMc/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uccT-NTYVMc/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uccT-NTYVMc/hqdefault.jpg	2018-03-23 06:33:16.183681	2023-09-02 13:01:28.164284	\N	t	1	97
