2328	QbPzS0eQwUQ	Consensus as a Service: OSI 20th Anniversary - Italo Vignoli- FOSSASIA 2018	2018-03-23 05:39:54	Speaker: Italo Vignoli, Director Open Source Iniiative (OSI)\nInfo: https://2018.fossasia.org/event/speakers.html#italo-vignoli3353\n\nThe Open Source label was born in February 1998 as a new wayto popularise free software for business adoption. OSI will celebrateits 20th Anniversary on February 3, 2018, during the opening day ofFOSDEM 2018. The presentation will summarize the evolution of opensource licenses and the Open Source Definition (OSD) across two decades,explain why the concept of free open source software has grown in bothrelevance and popularity and explore trends for the third decade of opensource.\n\nRoom: Lecture Theatre\nTrack: Open Source in Business\nDate: Friday, 23rd March, 10:00 - 10:25\n\nEvent Page: http://2018.fossasia.org\nFollow FOSSASIA on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fossasia/\nLike FOSSASIA on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fossasia/\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QbPzS0eQwUQ/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QbPzS0eQwUQ/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QbPzS0eQwUQ/hqdefault.jpg	2018-03-23 06:33:15.764638	2022-05-02 01:01:57.828856	\N	t	1	74
