2357	iG4fgZlmdb4	Inclusion and development - the Meilix Internet kiosk -Tarun Kumar- FOSSASIA 2018	2018-03-24 05:59:01	Speaker: Tarun Kumar, Developer FOSSASIA\nInfo: https://2018.fossasia.org/event/speakers.html#tarun-kumar3043\n\nAn internet kiosk is a special use case. A single computer is shared by an indefinite number of users. Lots of security concerns arise. In Asia and elsewhere multiple non-latin languages have to be supported. We decided to create a custom lightweight distribution Meilix and a generator web app that allows you to preconfigure an ISO with the wallpaper and desktop settings in place.\n\nRoom: Training room 4-3\nTrack:     Kernel & Platform\nDate: Friday, 23rd March, 2018\n\nEvent Page: http://2018.fossasia.org\nFollow FOSSASIA on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fossasia/\nLike FOSSASIA on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fossasia/ \n\nProduced by Engineers.SG	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iG4fgZlmdb4/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iG4fgZlmdb4/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iG4fgZlmdb4/hqdefault.jpg	2018-03-24 06:32:06.297745	2025-02-20 18:01:29.03728	\N	t	1	207
