1020	9o4idDBhc_A	Stepping into the future: Migrating & Deploying PHP7 - PHPConf.Asia 2016	2016-08-28 02:55:01	Speaker: Paul Dragoonis (@dr4goonis)\n\nThis talk covers the lessons learned on my journey of migrating small and large scale PHP platforms from PHP5 to PHP7. I will go into detail on preparing & analysing your current system to identify how ready your code is for the upgrade. Then I will show how to transition your local environment to PHP7 for testing and benchmarking. Lastly I will give tips and tricks on performing real-time deployments when upgrading your production infrastructure\n\nAbout the speaker:\n\nPaul, from Scotland, is passionate about software quality, architecture and continuous delivery. He spends his time contributing to the PHP project & php.net website, PHP-FIG, many frameworks and open source projects. He's a member of the PHP-FIG group and lead developer of PPI Framework Engine (www.ppi.io), where he focuses on multi-framework interoperability. When not working on software Paul enjoys fishing, martial arts and sleeping.\n\nEvent Page: https://2016.phpconf.asia\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG\n\nHelp us caption & translate this video!\n\nhttp://amara.org/v/VGXj/	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9o4idDBhc_A/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9o4idDBhc_A/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9o4idDBhc_A/hqdefault.jpg	2016-08-28 03:03:49.799678	2024-12-16 22:01:16.044583	\N	t	1	950
