72	qOAMM3RMzLQ	The Power Of Free: How LiMux serves 15.000 - Stefan Koehler - FOSSASIA Summit 2015	2015-03-17 06:08:02	Speaker: Stefan Koehler, CronusConsult \n\nDescription:\nThe LiMux project has gained worldwide attention in 2003 when the City Of Munich decided to replace Windows with a linux--based client. Today more than 15.000 clients run LiMux. LiMux heavily relies on popular FOSS components like (K)Ubuntu, LibreOffice or Firefox but also adds some self-made magic ingredients. This talk will shed some light on the techniques used and how they work together.\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qOAMM3RMzLQ/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qOAMM3RMzLQ/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qOAMM3RMzLQ/hqdefault.jpg	2015-05-07 15:32:31.171432	2023-05-29 04:00:50.113413	228	t	1	370
