1660	oubLLWVn_XE	4 levels of IT Architecture - Singapore PHP & Magento Combined Meetup	2017-04-18 14:37:36	Speaker: Shurn Heng\r\n\r\nOriginal Article: https://shurn.me/blog/2017-03-09/the-4-levels-of-it-architecture\r\n\r\nWhy does knowing the 4 levels of IT Architecture matter?\r\n\r\nIf you're someone not from IT background, how would this benefit you? Knowing how IT systems are planned and constructed helps you to understand the development process and the cost justification. Being able to understand your fellow IT collegues will certainly make a better team.\r\n\r\nIf you're someone already in the IT field, you probably already know about architectures. Knowing the 4 levels of architecture allows you to be an effective communicator, if your team/organisation still has trouble understanding one another. To speak in a team, requires common understanding of terms of words.\r\n\r\nEvent Page: https://www.facebook.com/events/197182374119251\r\n\r\nProduced by Engineers.SG\n\nHelp us caption & translate this video!\n\nhttp://amara.org/v/6IqM/	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oubLLWVn_XE/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oubLLWVn_XE/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oubLLWVn_XE/hqdefault.jpg	2017-04-18 15:04:40.637253	2024-07-19 19:01:32.208093	\N	t	1	99
