1908	U1uGMf4gCFU	Real Asset Backed Token - an Alternative Fundraising Structure - Blockchain Night@SGInnovate	2017-07-31 16:21:48	Speaker: Darvin Kurniawan, CEO and Co-founder, REIDAO\n\nIn the past few months fundraising activities through "ICO" has been on the rise especially for blockchain based startups. We will explore a new way of fundraising structure using token that is backed by real asset to protect participants interest, and generally make it safer.\n\nAbout the speaker\n\nDarvin is the CEO and Co-founder of Singapore-based blockchain startup REIDAO. REIDAO is creating digital assets backed by real estate, opening up a new way in getting exposure to real estate opportunities.\n\nEvent Page: https://www.eventbrite.sg/e/blockchain-nightsginnovate-tickets-35871523693\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG\n\nHelp us caption & translate this video!\n\nhttp://amara.org/v/9BJ4/	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U1uGMf4gCFU/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U1uGMf4gCFU/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U1uGMf4gCFU/hqdefault.jpg	2017-07-31 16:22:55.395294	2025-02-19 20:01:05.8454	\N	t	1	1662
3610	QuhRQgCEOEE	Comparing WooCommerce SaaS vs Managed Woocommerce Hosting - WordCamp Singapore 2019	2019-08-19 13:44:41	Speaker: Hazrul Azhar Jamari\n\nHazrul was the creator behind rezkii.com, a defunct woocommerce-as-a-service product. He feels WooCommerce is really painful for regular people to start a store and hosted platforms like Shopify are taking a lot from Woo’s pie. But have the industry caught up?\n\nThis presentation is a comparison of Managed WooCommerce Hosting (Pantheon, Nestify) and WooCommerce-as-a-service solutions (Woocart). It describes similarities and differences, and what it means to the non-techies who wish to use WooCommerce as their tech stack for their e-Commerce business.\n\nAnd he will also make a comparison between Woocart vs Shopify vs Ecwid and discuss the similarities and differences of each platform.\n\nIs Woocart the answer? Will Woocommerce ever go towards Woo-as-a-service? Perhaps there’ll be more questions than answers. Find out in this talk.\n\nAbout the speaker\n\nI’m a family man, entrepreneur, software engineer, and foodie, and have been building startups all my life. I have gone through a complete cycle of E-Commerce from training, building online and mobile e-store, building payment gateways and building a fulflllment and distribution system throughout my career.\n\nEvent Page: https://2019.singapore.wordcamp.org/sessions/#wcorg-session-1138\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG\n\nHelp us caption & translate this video!\n\nhttps://amara.org/v/BEH5R/	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QuhRQgCEOEE/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QuhRQgCEOEE/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QuhRQgCEOEE/hqdefault.jpg	2019-08-19 14:31:46.719376	2025-01-15 23:01:47.433519	\N	t	1	212
