2421	EcL8zAMSbBo	Optimize all the things with MiniZinc - Melvin Zhang - FOSSASIA 2018	2018-03-25 03:43:30	Speaker: Melvin Zhang\nInfo: https://2018.fossasia.org/event/speakers.html#melvin-zhang3241\n\nWhat do Sudoku and finding a shortest route to deliver a set of packages have in common? Both are hard problems which require us to find the best solution satisfying multiple constraints. Instead of writing a custom program for each problem, we can describe the problem in MiniZinc and then use a generic solver to find the solution. This session will demo how we can model a variety of problems in MiniZinc, a free and open-source constraint modelling language.\n\nTrack: Artificial Intelligence\nRoom: Event Hall 2-1\nDate: Sunday, 25th March,  2018\n\nEvent Page: http://2018.fossasia.org\nFollow FOSSASIA on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fossasia/\nLike FOSSASIA on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fossasia/\n\nProduced by Engineers.SG	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EcL8zAMSbBo/default.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EcL8zAMSbBo/mqdefault.jpg	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EcL8zAMSbBo/hqdefault.jpg	2018-03-25 04:30:45.950896	2025-02-28 17:01:27.823706	\N	t	1	3431
